{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8fcd37ab859cd7dc","name":"Mercenary Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-8fcd37ab859cd7dc","title":"Mercenary Talent Tree","revision":26768,"timestamp":"2025-07-21T18:14:50Z","sha256":"708567f5cd5992f8e4ccb0496dd3715cf511d412d2a96b029867f16bdc0dee5b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26768","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mercenary%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8fcd37ab859cd7dc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mercenaries are blasters-for-hire who sell their services to the highest bidder. Though money might motivate them, few types of soldiers are more capable of operating independently. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this Talent Tree can be used to qualify for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Trooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Trooper","referenceId":"reference:02fa86cb25e21540"}," Prestige Class, in addition to those listed in the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Commanding Presence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can activate this Talent as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". Until the end of the encounter, all your opponents within 6 squares of you take a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect. Additionally, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," is now considered a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skill"}," for you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dirty Fighting"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, if you successfully damage an opponent with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you reduce the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," by 2 points for the remainder of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Feared Warrior"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Commanding Presence"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your abilities on the battlefield are well known and feared. When you reduce an opponent to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," with an attack, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," against all targets within 6 squares. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", that target takes a -2 penalty on attack rolls for the remainder of the encounter. This Talent affects any given target only once per encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Focused Warrior"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your training makes you confident and disciplined in combat. When you successfully deal damage to an opponent in combat, you gain a +5 morale bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn. You lose this bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," for any reason.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ruthless Mercenary"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Ruthless in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Ruthless"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ruthless"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dirty Fighting"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you deal damage to a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll that exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target for the remainder of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Combined Mercenary Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Combined Fire in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Combined Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combined_Fire"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coordinated Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coordinated_Attack","referenceId":"reference:62402b39143dcd42"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls on attacks against targets that have been damaged by an ally since the end of your last turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mercenary's Determination"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Mercenary's Grit"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", on your turn, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," for 1 round. You must wait 5 rounds between each use of this ability.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mercenary's Grit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are affected by any debilitating condition, you can convert the condition's modifier from a penalty to a bonus for 1 round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". At the end of your next turn, move -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mercenary's Teamwork"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Combined Mercenary Fire"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coordinated Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coordinated_Attack","referenceId":"reference:62402b39143dcd42"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls for each ally that has damaged your target since the end of your last turn (to a maximum of +10).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
